WEBVTT

00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:14.580
What a beautiful voice.

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:17.930
It reminds me of the chimes 
that echo through purgatory.

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:22.540
What will you do now?

00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:28.730
With your identity now known, 
things cannot continue as they have before.

00:00:29.620 --> 00:00:30.980
I'm aware.

00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:32.260
Oh?

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:35.260
I'm interested now...

00:00:35.690 --> 00:00:37.010
In the covenants

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:42.090
that Dantalion and I formed 
with Solomon long ago.

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:22.660
What is with this school and 
its love for events like these?

00:02:22.920 --> 00:02:26.770
Shakespeare, huh? I'm not a fan, myself...

00:02:27.390 --> 00:02:30.460
I preferred the Greek myth they did last year.

00:02:30.460 --> 00:02:32.580
Yet you cry in Greek language class.

00:02:32.580 --> 00:02:36.540
Well, there are always all those 
ghosts in Shakespeare's works.

00:02:36.540 --> 00:02:38.090
It gives me the creeps!

00:02:39.350 --> 00:02:41.230
There is no such thing as ghosts!

00:02:41.230 --> 00:02:44.560
There are! Shakespeare saw them himself!

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:46.440
If he did, they were made of atoms.

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:47.980
You're so stubborn!

00:02:47.980 --> 00:02:52.060
You can trust me to interpret 
the work correctly.

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:56.320
What's with that outfit?

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:59.280
I am the King of Denmark, Claudius!

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:03.110
It suits you! How fitting 
for the next interim ruler!

00:03:03.110 --> 00:03:03.950
A rare star!

00:03:07.230 --> 00:03:10.210
The man who killed the ruling king 
and usurped the throne, huh?

00:03:10.520 --> 00:03:12.230
Fitting, indeed.

00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:13.080
What?

00:03:13.870 --> 00:03:16.240
A virtuous soul blessed with ultimate beauty.

00:03:16.650 --> 00:03:18.960
That is Ophelia, the one I will portray.

00:03:20.030 --> 00:03:22.260
The role was made for me.

00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:27.300
There was just no one else who wanted the role.

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:28.140
Excuse me?!

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:29.280
Am I wrong?

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:30.070
Yes!

00:03:30.070 --> 00:03:31.100
<i>God...</i>

00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:33.060
<i>If you do exist, do your damn job!</i>

00:03:33.550 --> 00:03:35.680
You're not going to be in the play, William?

00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:38.820
Sorry, but I've no desire to 
perform in front of a crowd.

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:41.260
I'm directing the play.

00:03:41.810 --> 00:03:45.370
What happened to the so-called 
power struggle in Hell, anyway?

00:03:45.820 --> 00:03:48.030
Can they afford to spend all their time playing?

00:03:48.030 --> 00:03:48.910
Young Master!

00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:51.440
What is it, Kevin?

00:03:52.090 --> 00:03:54.040
I have a small favor to ask.

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:58.300
Then I have one for you, as well.

00:04:06.380 --> 00:04:08.220
Hi, darling!

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:12.420
A mirage. You're a mirage. Begone, phantom!

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:15.520
Oh my, did my cuteness blind you?

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:19.040
Sytry's in the underclassmen's room.

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:20.320
Just get him and leave.

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:21.300
Oh, my.

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:23.900
And what will you be doing?

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:28.220
Today is the annual Great Sabbat.

00:04:28.220 --> 00:04:30.720
You know you can't afford not to come.

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:37.340
Three of the candidates for 
interim ruler will be there, after all.

00:04:44.890 --> 00:04:48.350
I did love you once.

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:51.790
Indeed, my lord, you made me believe so.

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:53.580
You should not...

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:56.810
should not have believed...

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:05.570
If it's so embarrassing, 
why did you agree to direct the play?

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:07.360
Why do you think?

00:05:09.150 --> 00:05:12.100
The director gets attention without 
even having to be on stage.

00:05:12.100 --> 00:05:13.000
Plus it helps my grades!

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:15.360
Brilliantly pragmatic and greedy!

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:20.310
And what about you? 
Why did you call me here?

00:05:20.310 --> 00:05:22.670
To encourage you, of course.

00:05:23.350 --> 00:05:27.500
I've got money on which play 
will get the best reviews,

00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:29.550
so I really want you at your best!

00:05:29.880 --> 00:05:31.060
Again?

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:37.000
I've told you over and over to stop 
gambling. You still haven't learned?

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:37.850
Young Master!

00:05:39.380 --> 00:05:41.510
Sorry, something on your back.

00:05:53.890 --> 00:05:55.320
Hey, Twining.

00:05:55.690 --> 00:05:58.250
Two of the residents requested 
leave for tonight. Here.

00:05:58.790 --> 00:06:01.200
At this hour? Who?

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:04.760
Dantalion Huber and Sytry Cartwright.

00:06:05.150 --> 00:06:06.970
They both said they were going home.

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:08.010
When?!

00:06:08.010 --> 00:06:09.080
Just now.

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:11.660
Urgent family matters, they said.

00:06:11.660 --> 00:06:13.180
Family?

00:06:14.070 --> 00:06:17.430
<i>Then they went back to Hell?</i>

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:22.060
<i>God's finally doing His job!</i>

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:25.410
It's too bad we'll have to cancel rehearsal...

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:29.040
What's that pose for?

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:32.740
N-Nothing at all.

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:46.800
Dantalion, dance with me!

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:49.610
I'm not in the mood to play with children.

00:06:50.790 --> 00:06:53.590
Worried about leaving Solomon behind?

00:06:53.590 --> 00:06:56.100
Greetings, Your Excellency Astaroth.

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:59.090
If you want him that badly, 
just pushing isn't enough.

00:06:59.530 --> 00:07:01.000
Sometimes you have to pull away.

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:01.970
Pull away?

00:07:02.410 --> 00:07:05.220
I think Beelzebub said the same thing once.

00:07:05.220 --> 00:07:06.610
Don't bring that up!

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:10.410
That reminds me, he should be here now...

00:07:10.770 --> 00:07:14.580
Not just Beelzebub! 
All of the Four Kings are here!

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:16.800
And the candidates for interim ruler, too!

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:26.170
The Elector is more strong-willed 
than we gave him credit for.

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:31.990
Normally there'd be no reason 
for you to go in person, Sytry.

00:07:31.990 --> 00:07:35.660
Yes, but we can't have the 
Nephilim slipping ahead of us.

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:39.420
Elector or not, he's still just a human.

00:07:39.970 --> 00:07:42.660
All we need is his soul.

00:07:43.010 --> 00:07:44.810
Its vessel is unnecessary.

00:07:46.060 --> 00:07:47.090
<i>Vessel?</i>

00:07:47.990 --> 00:07:51.410
Someday, the Nephilim will 
disappear from Hell entirely.

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:54.110
We needn't wait for His Highness Lucifer's
replacement to take the throne.

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:55.570
Uncle, that's—

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:00.410
My pretty little puppet...

00:08:01.190 --> 00:08:05.030
I trust you haven't forgotten your heritage?

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:10.750
That's it.

00:08:11.350 --> 00:08:13.630
That's what I like to see.

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:21.490
Grand Duchess of the South, Lady Astaroth.

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:26.610
Grand Duke of the East, Lord Samael.

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:31.280
Grand Duke of the West, Lord Baalberith,

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:33.380
accompanied by Viscount Sytry.

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:35.970
He's very elegant.

00:08:35.970 --> 00:08:38.620
A far cry from our own wild child.

00:08:39.430 --> 00:08:41.850
Greetings, Your Excellency Astaroth.

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:44.660
Where might Dantalion be?

00:08:46.590 --> 00:08:49.090
No idea. He was here just a moment ago.

00:08:50.260 --> 00:08:52.520
<i>What is he doing at such a crucial time?</i>

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:55.160
<i>His lack of decorum knows no bounds.</i>

00:08:56.940 --> 00:08:58.510
Grand Duke of the North,

00:08:58.510 --> 00:09:00.140
Head of Evil Spirits,

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:03.690
Lord of the Flies, Lord Beelzebub,

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:08.670
accompanied by Great President Camio.

00:09:15.090 --> 00:09:17.770
Camio may be half human,

00:09:17.770 --> 00:09:20.370
but he carries the blood of His Highness Lucifer.

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:25.080
Rumor has it his powers eclipse 
even those of us Four Kings.

00:09:25.800 --> 00:09:28.170
Greetings, Lord Baalberith.

00:09:28.520 --> 00:09:31.010
I'm happy to see that the Sabbat is a success.

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:38.240
I'd like to call it a splendid gathering, 
but I believe we're still short one guest.

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:40.700
Are you referring to Dantalion?

00:09:41.670 --> 00:09:45.940
He has no manners whatsoever. 
Please forgive him.

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:48.270
Actually, I didn't mean him.

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:52.650
The lone human upon
whom His Highness Lucifer

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:55.740
bestowed the right to 
choose Hell's interim ruler.

00:09:56.180 --> 00:09:58.780
Son of David, King of Israel,

00:09:58.780 --> 00:10:02.580
blessed by God with wisdom 
surpassing all mankind,

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:04.540
Solomon.

00:10:05.520 --> 00:10:06.660
Solomon?

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:08.790
Solomon's coming?

00:10:27.680 --> 00:10:30.940
<i>Why must I, a Grand Duke of Hell, do all this?!</i>

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:31.940
<i>Hey, Solomon!</i>

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:33.920
<b>Buried</b>

00:10:35.010 --> 00:10:39.360
<i>Sick man, thou shalt steep cypress and herbs.</i>

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:42.490
<i>It smells so good.</i>

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:43.510
<i>Honestly...</i>

00:10:43.940 --> 00:10:48.040
<i>I can't fathom how a shut-in like 
you can be the wisest man on Earth.</i>

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:51.540
<i>What does it matter? I've still got you.</i>

00:10:52.870 --> 00:10:54.840
<i>Oh, fetch that milk.</i>

00:10:55.360 --> 00:10:56.760
<i>Don't treat me like an errand boy!</i>

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:04.580
<i>Everyone has their strengths and weaknesses.</i>

00:11:05.150 --> 00:11:07.440
<i>I'm perfectly content to stay here</i>

00:11:08.370 --> 00:11:10.980
<i>and pass the time reading.</i>

00:11:11.450 --> 00:11:12.560
<i>You can't, Solomon!</i>

00:11:13.390 --> 00:11:14.330
<i>Why?</i>

00:11:14.330 --> 00:11:15.520
<i>If you stay...</i>

00:11:16.130 --> 00:11:18.360
<i>If you remain here, eventually you'll be...</i>

00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:19.360
<i>I know.</i>

00:11:20.580 --> 00:11:23.780
<i>My father accuses me of heresy.</i>

00:11:24.630 --> 00:11:26.450
<i>He'll come for me sooner or later.</i>

00:11:26.810 --> 00:11:31.120
<i>I'll kill you myself before I 
let anyone lay a hand on you.</i>

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:34.330
<i>If you wish, I'll do it this instant!</i>

00:11:35.310 --> 00:11:36.540
<i>If I wish...</i>

00:11:40.310 --> 00:11:41.360
<i>Indeed.</i>

00:11:41.360 --> 00:11:44.550
<i>Someday, you will grant my wish.</i>

00:11:50.740 --> 00:11:53.770
<i>Someday, you will kill me.</i>

00:11:56.490 --> 00:11:58.190
What was that dream trying to say?

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:00.940
Duke Dantalion!

00:12:01.250 --> 00:12:03.530
The Elector's in big trouble!

00:12:04.260 --> 00:12:05.360
William?!

00:12:22.260 --> 00:12:24.090
William!

00:12:26.210 --> 00:12:29.060
Worried about Dantalion and Sytry?

00:12:29.340 --> 00:12:31.600
I-I'm not worried about anyone!

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:35.340
I was just noticing how 
dreadful the fog is tonight.

00:12:37.210 --> 00:12:38.900
What's that?

00:12:44.510 --> 00:12:45.600
William?

00:12:55.650 --> 00:12:58.240
The barrier is wavering.

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:03.300
What is that?!

00:13:10.340 --> 00:13:12.830
It's a huge legion of demons!

00:13:13.320 --> 00:13:14.940
It's like a Sabbat!

00:13:15.400 --> 00:13:16.690
This is...

00:13:18.220 --> 00:13:19.590
a dream.

00:13:19.590 --> 00:13:22.900
It's not a dream! The demons 
are about to have a party!

00:13:35.190 --> 00:13:36.290
Sytry?!

00:13:36.630 --> 00:13:38.710
I thought you returned to Hell?!

00:13:39.020 --> 00:13:41.420
I came back to save you!

00:13:41.780 --> 00:13:43.010
Save me?

00:13:43.390 --> 00:13:44.930
Say you choose me!

00:13:46.030 --> 00:13:46.800
Now!

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:48.800
This is no time for that—

00:13:49.110 --> 00:13:52.220
If you elect me, it gives 
me a reason to protect you!

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:54.680
Even from my own uncle!

00:13:55.760 --> 00:13:57.640
Elect this, elect that!

00:13:57.640 --> 00:14:00.190
I am not Solomon and I'm not the Elector!

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:01.530
How many times do I have to say it?!

00:14:08.560 --> 00:14:09.450
Sytry!

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:10.950
No, William!

00:14:15.960 --> 00:14:19.790
Tonight is the night when the barrier 
between our two worlds vanishes.

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:23.290
Right now, a horde of demons 
has gone to welcome Solomon—

00:14:23.290 --> 00:14:24.250
Wrong.

00:14:24.770 --> 00:14:27.450
You mean they've gone to kill him.

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:35.470
Wouldn't Solomon's death benefit you
every bit as much as it does me?

00:14:35.990 --> 00:14:40.020
I thought you'd be happy to finally 
be free of that ancient covenant.

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:43.070
Was I mistaken?

00:14:56.470 --> 00:14:57.870
Didn't I tell you?

00:14:57.870 --> 00:14:59.920
I warned you things were 
going to get dangerous.

00:15:00.850 --> 00:15:05.130
The demons Solomon didn't form a 
pact with are coming after me?

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:06.310
Exactly!

00:15:06.310 --> 00:15:09.380
By not choosing anyone,
you essentially leave yourself unarmed.

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:11.950
They see you as the ideal prey!

00:15:13.240 --> 00:15:15.980
<i>Those things are all trying to kill me?</i>

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:21.080
They're Baalberith's underlings. What a hassle.

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:24.760
Guess I'll just slaughter them.

00:15:31.790 --> 00:15:32.500
Wha—

00:15:32.500 --> 00:15:33.510
Wow!

00:15:34.140 --> 00:15:38.500
Even if they're low level demons, 
the gap in their powers is enormous.

00:15:41.240 --> 00:15:43.320
Don't bother struggling.

00:15:43.320 --> 00:15:45.570
I'm going to obliterate all of you!

00:16:15.970 --> 00:16:16.910
Dantalion!

00:16:30.790 --> 00:16:32.470
Wh-What is that?

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:35.390
A magic circle created by the powers of heaven.

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:39.680
It appears someone's placed 
a barrier over this area.

00:16:46.660 --> 00:16:47.880
My powers...

00:16:49.460 --> 00:16:51.070
An exorcist?

00:16:51.550 --> 00:16:55.910
No, no human is capable of 
something this powerful.

00:17:09.930 --> 00:17:12.440
Please distance yourself, Sir William.

00:17:13.450 --> 00:17:16.350
Staying this close to 
Duke Dantalion is dangerous.

00:17:19.120 --> 00:17:22.360
If he were to unleash his full power,

00:17:22.360 --> 00:17:26.090
the entire school might 
be razed to the ground.

00:17:45.850 --> 00:17:46.940
Dantalion...

00:17:49.100 --> 00:17:52.380
<i>Someday, you will grant my wish.</i>

00:17:59.130 --> 00:18:00.390
Dantalion, stop!

00:18:18.730 --> 00:18:19.450
Solomon—

00:18:29.700 --> 00:18:31.150
Calm yourself.

00:18:32.740 --> 00:18:33.690
Camio?

00:18:33.690 --> 00:18:36.720
A demon of your stature should 
never lose control like that.

00:18:45.540 --> 00:18:47.330
William, are you okay?

00:18:47.330 --> 00:18:48.820
Y-Yeah...

00:18:55.840 --> 00:18:59.950
Begone. I will not allow anyone, no matter who,

00:19:00.640 --> 00:19:02.490
to bring harm to Solomon.

00:19:17.100 --> 00:19:19.140
The demons all went away.

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:22.980
They were just an illusion caused 
by electrical discharges.

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:26.090
Try reading some of Ben Franklin's essays.

00:19:26.090 --> 00:19:27.980
Well, today is a Sabbat.

00:19:28.620 --> 00:19:31.970
That's probably why they were all so rowdy!

00:19:40.660 --> 00:19:42.030
Ridiculous!

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:43.490
Sabbat, my foot.

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:45.590
It was just fog that happened 
to look like demons!

00:19:46.310 --> 00:19:47.830
The fog had already cleared!

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:50.080
Forget Sabbat. It's time for Shakespeare.

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:54.380
Sytry, Dantalion, you'd better know your lines.

00:19:54.950 --> 00:19:56.880
Get back to the dorm for rehearsal.

00:20:05.760 --> 00:20:09.330
Lamia, the party's over. Let's go.

00:20:13.780 --> 00:20:16.180
Huh? Where's Dantalion?

00:20:16.180 --> 00:20:20.070
Apparently, he didn't care for the festivities.

00:20:20.870 --> 00:20:24.280
Neither did your candidate.

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:30.300
Or His Lordship's pretty 
puppet, for that matter.

00:20:32.600 --> 00:20:34.520
What a fiasco.

00:20:34.990 --> 00:20:38.590
They're all completely 
enamored with Solomon...

00:20:39.730 --> 00:20:42.880
Just as we are.

00:20:49.240 --> 00:20:50.870
Twining, emergency!

00:20:50.870 --> 00:20:51.600
What's wrong?

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:54.240
Heinz came down with appendicitis!

00:20:54.240 --> 00:20:57.150
What?! But he's Hamlet!

00:20:57.450 --> 00:21:01.070
What do we do? It's too 
late to cancel the show...

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:03.530
We need a replacement.

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:06.010
Yeah, but who?

00:21:08.390 --> 00:21:12.050
The only person who knows all 
the lines is you, our director!

00:21:12.050 --> 00:21:12.940
Twining!

00:21:14.740 --> 00:21:18.590
If the curtain fails to rise, 
your stock is sure to fall.

00:21:21.400 --> 00:21:23.340
To be or not to be?

00:21:24.770 --> 00:21:26.370
That is the question!

00:21:27.280 --> 00:21:29.340
<i>Why am I doing this?</i>

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:34.730
My lord, I come to return the 
tokens of love you once gave me.

00:21:40.070 --> 00:21:42.480
Hey, Sytry, this isn't that kind of scene!

00:21:42.750 --> 00:21:46.610
Lord Hamlet, say that you choose me.

00:21:48.310 --> 00:21:49.240
Freeze!

00:21:50.030 --> 00:21:53.290
You will choose me!

00:21:56.230 --> 00:21:57.250
Hang on!

00:21:57.580 --> 00:21:59.670
What do you think you're touching?! I'll sue!

00:21:59.670 --> 00:22:02.000
Get off him! He belongs to me!

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:03.040
Who cares?! Wil—

00:22:03.040 --> 00:22:03.780
<b>Snap</b>

00:22:04.160 --> 00:22:09.140
Are you trying to ruin my play?!

00:23:40.400 --> 00:23:43.060
Hi! I'm sure you know who I am.

00:23:43.060 --> 00:23:45.760
The archangel Michael, 
who passes judgment on

00:23:45.760 --> 00:23:47.260
those who sin against Heaven.

00:23:47.260 --> 00:23:49.860
Now hurry up and kneel before me.

00:23:49.860 --> 00:23:52.720
Once upon a time, I was known 
and feared as "Bluebeard,"

00:23:52.720 --> 00:23:54.700
but I'm not <i>that</i> hairy!
